"name":"Álvaro Mayo","role":"RosD2"},{"id":1808440,"name":"Ángel Carmona","role":"Radio Program Announcer"},{"id":5474322,"name":"Xavi Rocamora","role":"Radio News Announcer"},{"id":5178543,"name":"Íria Sena","role":"Riger's Friend"},{"id":3892294,"name":"Ramon Ortiz","role":"Pool Boy"},{"id":5474325,"name":"Manel Sánchez","role":"Juggling Boy"},{"id":1474750,"name":"David Ortíz","role":"Police Officer in Car"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Viaggio di maturità: Mallorca","overview":"2021. Dopo un anno in lockdown, un gruppo di studenti parte per il viaggio di maturità a Mallorca. Questo piano perfetto prevede di recuperare il tempo perso e divertirsi come non mai. Tuttavia, un'epidemia di COVID sconvolge i loro piani e li costringe a rimanere chiusi in hotel. Più di 50 studenti in un hotel con appena due insegnanti e molti, moltissimi minibar. Cosa mai potrebbe andare storto?"},{"language":"en-US","title":"Graduation Trip: Mallorca","overview":"2021. After spending a year in confinement, a group of high school students and their two teachers begin an end-of-year trip to Mallorca. This great plan is the last opportunity they have to all be together, make up for lost time, be able to have fun like they have never had before and say goodbye to this crazy stage of their lives. However, a new coronavirus outbreak disrupts all their plans and forces them to stay locked in their hotel rooms. More than 50 students, 2 teachers, a hotel and many, many minibars... What could go wrong?"},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"2021. Tras pasar un año de confinamiento, un grupo de estudiantes de bachillerato y sus dos profesoras inician un viaje de fin de curso a Mallorca. Este planazo supone la última oportunidad que tienen de estar todos juntos, recuperar el tiempo perdido, poder divertirse como nunca lo han hecho y despedir está loca etapa de sus vidas. Sin embargo, un nuevo brote de coronavirus trunca todos sus planes y les obliga a quedarse encerrados en las habitaciones del hotel. Más de 50 alumnos, 2 profesoras, un hotel y muchos, muchos minibares… ¿Qué podría salir mal?"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2zeJSeyPkYKJdOlxfzyePuG4SId.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2zeJSeyPkYKJdOlxfzyePuG4SId.png","language":"en","width":1993,"height":538},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lfRYbQjSTPFDZpXtnElrh1vf0Vm.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lfRYbQjSTPFDZpXtnElrh1vf0Vm.png","language":"es","width":3000,"height":699}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oAt2TRbE5061rx1ubkd7mLGz4DS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oAt2TRbE5061rx1ubkd7mLGz4DS.jpg","language":"it","width":1920,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ejYX4ygRoupGRjFgmmtnK0sMxhN.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ejYX4ygRoupGRjFgmmtnK0sMxhN.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A8E8EqXqETV8ggPiOkHjaBU8H9N.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A8E8EqXqETV8ggPiOkHjaBU8H9N.jpg","language":"es","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ihVoUq8ja3EvEHRZhcwf8OkIy73.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ihVoUq8ja3EvEHRZhcwf8OkIy73.jpg","language":"es","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wLsDuUZnvfwQy6cGjrSZkgtkWNc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wLsDuUZnvfwQy6cGjrSZkgtkWNc.jpg","language":"es","width":640,"height":960},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uNFmuWGyFDqwR9yYnxzHLgdARWR.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uNFmuWGyFDqwR9yYnxzHLgdARWR.jpg","language":"es","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xaseG09Squ2R8Yc